{
  "title": "EC2 Purchasing Options · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "작업의 지속 시간과 중단 허용 여부에 맞춰 EC2 비용 방식을 선택합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Purchasing Options</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#guide-1\">대표적인 요금 방식</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#guide-2\">할인과 용량 보장 구분하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>17 / 62</span></div><h1>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Purchasing Options</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EC2의 구매 방식은 <strong>서버를 얼마나 오래 사용할지, 사용량을 약정할 수 있는지, 작업 중단을 허용할 수 있는지</strong>에 따라 선택합니다. 같은 성능이라도 운영 조건에 따라 적합한 요금 방식이 달라집니다.</p><p>먼저 항상 필요한 기본 용량과 일시적으로 필요한 용량을 나누면 판단하기 쉽습니다. 비용 할인과 실행할 용량의 확보도 각각 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"on-demand-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"spot-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"spot-interruption-and-rebalance\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"spot-fleet-and-ec2-fleet\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"compute-savings-plans\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ec2-instance-savings-plans\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"other-savings-plans\"></span><h2>대표적인 요금 방식</h2><p><strong>온디맨드:</strong> 장기 약정 없이 필요한 만큼 사용합니다. 사용량을 예측하기 어렵거나 처음 시작하는 서비스에 적합합니다.</p><p><strong>Savings Plans·예약 인스턴스:</strong> 일정 기간의 사용을 약정해 할인을 받습니다. Savings Plans는 사용 금액 약정과 적용 범위를, 예약 인스턴스는 인스턴스 구성 및 범위 조건을 확인합니다.</p><p><strong>Spot:</strong> 여유 용량을 할인받아 사용하지만 회수될 수 있습니다. 재시작 가능한 배치, 분산 처리, 임시 작업에 적용하고 중단 대응을 준비합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"standard-reserved-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"convertible-reserved-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"all-upfront-partial-upfront-and-no-upfront\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dedicated-hosts\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dedicated-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"on-demand-capacity-reservations\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"capacity-blocks\"></span><h2>할인과 용량 보장 구분하기</h2><p>할인 약정만으로 원하는 시점의 실행 용량이 항상 확보되는 것은 아닙니다. 특정 AZ에서 용량을 확보해야 한다면 용량 예약<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>과 해당 구매 방식의 조건을 확인합니다.</p><p>전용 물리 서버 사용이나 라이선스 요구가 있다면 Dedicated Hosts 등을 검토합니다. 사용하지 않는 약정이나 예약도 비용에 영향을 주므로 실제 사용 패턴을 먼저 분석합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>구매 방식을 결정하는 질문</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ul class=\"concept-flow concept-comparison\"><li><strong>사용이 꾸준한가</strong><span>약정 할인 검토</span></li><li><strong>중단을 허용하는가</strong><span>Spot 검토</span></li><li><strong>용량을 확보해야 하나</strong><span>용량 예약 검토</span></li></ul><p class=\"diagram-note\">각 조건은 함께 판단합니다. 하나의 서비스에서 여러 구매 방식을 조합할 수 있습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>항상 실행하는 API 서버의 기본 용량에는 약정 할인을 적용하고, 언제든 다시 실행할 수 있는 야간 배치에는 Spot을 사용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>용량 예약</strong> — 특정 조건의 EC2 실행 용량을 확보하는 기능입니다. 요금 할인 약정과 목적이 다르므로 필요한 용량과 비용 조건을 따로 확인합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-on-demand-instances.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Purchasing On-Demand Instances for Amazon EC2 ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/using-spot-instances.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spot Instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/spot-interruptions.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spot Instance interruptions ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-fleet.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">EC2 Fleet and Spot Fleet ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-5\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/savingsplans/latest/userguide/plan-types.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Savings Plans types ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-6\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/reserved-instances-types.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Types of Reserved Instances (offering classes) ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-7\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/reserved-instances-scope.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Regional and zonal Reserved Instances (scope) ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-8\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/instance-purchasing-options.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EC2 billing and purchasing options ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-9\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/dedicated-hosts-overview.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EC2 Dedicated Hosts ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-10\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/dedicated-instance.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EC2 Dedicated Instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-11\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-capacity-reservations.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Reserve compute capacity with EC2 On-Demand Capacity Reservations ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q032\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q034\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q034\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q034</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q034/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A large rendering batch can tolerate interruption and retry. Which EC2 purchasing option can reduce its cost?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q034\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q034\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q034\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q034\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">On-Demand Instances only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>은 중단 가능 작업에서 유휴 용량 할인을 활용한다. 체크포인트와 재시도를 준비한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q035\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q035\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q035</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q035/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a stable level of compute usage over a long period. Which commitment-based option can reduce costs compared with On-Demand usage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 일정 사용량 약정과 교환해 할인한다. 약정 범위와 유형은 사용 패턴에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q046\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q046\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q046</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q046/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Reserved Instances in shared tenancy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 다른 계정과 Hardware를 분리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>의 Host 제어가 필요하지 않은 요구와 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 그 자체로 Dedicated Tenancy를 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q098\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">이전 용어 <b>EC2 Auto Scaling</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">다음 용어 <b>ECS / EKS / Fargate</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
